@host = http://localhost:5015

### 1. Create a short URL  -> expect 201 + Location header
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/some/very/long/path?a=1&b=2" }

### 2. Stats for the code just created -> expect 200, clickCount 0
GET {{host}}/api/urls/{{create.response.body.code}}/stats
Accept: application/json

### 3. Follow the short code -> expect 302 + Location: originalUrl
GET {{host}}/{{create.response.body.code}}

### 4. Stats again -> clickCount should now be 1
GET {{host}}/api/urls/{{create.response.body.code}}/stats
Accept: application/json

### --- validation / negative cases ---

### 5. Not an absolute http(s) URL -> expect 400 ProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "notaurl" }

### 6. Disallowed scheme -> expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "ftp://example.com/file.txt" }

### 7. javascript: scheme (XSS via redirect) -> expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "javascript:alert(1)" }

### 8. Missing url field -> expect 400 (model validation)
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 9. Empty body -> expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Malformed JSON -> expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com"

### 11. Unknown code -> expect 404
GET {{host}}/api/urls/zzzzz/stats

### 12. Unknown code redirect -> expect 404
GET {{host}}/zzzzz

### 13. Code with invalid chars -> expect 404 (route regex rejects, never reaches handler)
GET {{host}}/api/urls/ab_cd/stats

### 14. Code longer than 11 chars -> expect 404 (route regex rejects)
GET {{host}}/api/urls/abcdefghijkl/stats

### 15. Wrong verb on collection -> expect 405
GET {{host}}/api/urls

### 16. Swagger UI (Development only)
GET {{host}}/swagger/index.html
